{"name":"日本巡る自転車旅","short_name":"日本巡る","lang":"ja","start_url":"./","scope":"./","display":"standalone","orientation":"portrait","background_color":"#1e2125","theme_color":"#2a2118","icons":[{"src":"img/app_384.png","sizes":"384x384","type":"image/png","purpose":"any"},{"src":"img/app_512.png","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png","purpose":"any"},{"src":"img/app_mask.png","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png","purpose":"maskable"}],"id":"./","description":"自転車旅インフルエンサーになって、日本全国47都道府県のキャンプ場を巡るブラウザRPG。自転車・ギア・補給食を整え、天候や悪路の試練を乗り越え、焚き火とキャンプでフォロワーを増やそう。スマホでもPCでも、インストール不要で遊べます。","categories":["games","entertainment"]}